OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after woman found
OL,4,Adead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a woman died in a
OL,8,Fcoastal town, police have said.
OL,10,FPolice and paramedics were called to
OL,11,Freports of a man creating a disturbance
OL,12,Fat a property on Newcomen Road,
OL,13,FDartmouth, at about 21:20 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FDevon and Cornwall Police said a woman
OL,17,Fin her 40s was pronounced dead at the
OL,18,Fscene with a man in his 40s taken to
OL,19,Fhospital having sustained facial
OL,20,Finjuries which are not believed to be
OL,21,Flife-changing.
